      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B001",
      "text": "Retrying repeatedly calls the function while the retry predicate requests another attempt and stops when the function succeeds or a stop policy triggers."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B002",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B002",
      "text": "Track a `RetryCallState` with `attempt_number`, `outcome`, `idle_for`, `upcoming_sleep`, and `seconds_since_start`."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B003",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B003",
      "text": "When retries are exhausted, Retrying calls retry_error_callback if configured, reraises the final exception when requested, or raises RetryError."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B004",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B004",
      "text": "retry_if_exception_type retries matching exceptions and retry_if_result retries matching returned results."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B005",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B005",
      "text": "Retry predicates composed with | or & apply retry-any or retry-all semantics in operand order."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B006",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B006",
      "text": "stop_after_attempt, stop_after_delay, and stop_before_delay stop according to attempt count and elapsed or upcoming delay boundaries."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B007",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B007",
      "text": "wait_fixed, wait_none, wait_chain, wait_combine, and wait_exponential compute deterministic upcoming sleep durations; an empty wait_chain raises ValueError."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B008",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B008",
      "text": "before_sleep receives the updated retry state before idle_for is incremented, and retry_error_callback receives the exhausted state. At before_sleep, attempt_number is the attempt that just finished and has not yet been incremented for the next attempt."
    },
    {
